{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志下","commonName":"历代志下","title":"历代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"686ce221582f699b247061de865d425af7f7a8470b8e24b68b4cadccf8f25efa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":818},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["犹大王约坦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["约坦二十五岁登基，在耶路撒冷执政十六年。他母亲叫耶路莎，是撒督的女儿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["约坦事事效法他父亲乌西雅，做耶和华视为正的事，只是没有进耶和华的殿。民众仍继续败坏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["约坦建造耶和华殿的上门，大力修建俄斐勒的城墙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他还在犹大山区建造城邑，在树林中建造营寨和瞭望塔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他与亚扪人的王交战，打败了他们。在以后的三年中，亚扪人每年进贡六万八千两银子、小麦和大麦各二百二十万升。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["约坦日渐强盛，因为他坚守他的上帝耶和华的道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["约坦其他的事及一切战绩和功业，都记在《以色列和犹大列王史》上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他二十五岁登基，在耶路撒冷执政十六年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["约坦与祖先同眠后，葬在大卫城。他儿子亚哈斯继位。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}